SENTENCE | Plays df-hq from a fresh scratch copy with its real verbs: mark a 3x3 block of castle rock with dig_area, cancel one mark and set it again, then let the controlled dwarf walk until all nine cells are dug.
SENTENCE | Checks the DIG, DONE, give_item and EVRES rows in the ledger, the stone the dwarf carries, the Stocks and Units tab rows in ui.txt, then save to a slot, new game (rock back, stone gone), load (dug cells back) and a ledger replay in a fresh game.
